Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.02,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.65,0:00:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Unirune's Trip in Kachikochiland{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, Tomorune, where are you off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're going to see Unirune?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unirune is a Punirune with squishsterious powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's keeping the squishsterious forest safe\Nby turning kachi-freezy trees squishy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"How are you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Wanna come with us to Kachikochiland?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unirune has never been to Kachikochiland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It'll be lots of fun!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Plus, there's a puni-pal I want you to meet!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back! It's good to see you again, Unirune!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Off we go!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, you're leaving again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.34,0:03:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Oh my goodness..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The forest..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Airune too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unirune is about to turn kachi-freezy Airune squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Everyone is kachi-freezy here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Let's go see our puni-pal!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"This is Unirune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Welcome to Kachikochiland."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Allow us to entertain you with a dance."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Magnificent!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Unirune, there's something I just have to show you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Today is the kachi-freezy meteor shower—\Nwhen tons of shooting stars light up the night sky!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Follow me."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Want to take a break here?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"We've been walking forever\Nsince we left the castle."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I'm stuffed..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Indeed..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unirune used its squishsterious powers\Nto turn the kachi-freezy boulder squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The hill where we can watch the\Nkachi-freezy meteor shower is just up there!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It's still so far away..."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Don't worry—I've got this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the hill where they can watch\Nthe kachi-freezy meteor shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's too cloudy to see a single star.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I'm sorry. We came all this way."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"We'll be able to watch it."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Happyrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Fairune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That night—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}lit up not only by the kachi-freezy meteor shower,\Nbut the shower of puni-pals—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}became a very fond memory for Unirune and its friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Unirune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unirune was originally a legendary Punirune\Nthat no one had ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's super close friends with Tomorune!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can soar freely in the sky\Nand has squishsterious powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does Unirune live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(633.33,379.33)}1. The market
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(633.33,728.66)}2. The park
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(633.33,1035.33)}3. The squishsterious forest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,3. The squishsterious forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You made new puni-pals, Tsukurune and Sunrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:12:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting, so Tsukurune's gonna be\Na teacher and do science experiments!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. With someone as firey and cheerful\Nas Sunrune, it can only get even more exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Tsukurune and Sunrune{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
